      "message": "The kernel_aarch64 build fails claiming the symbol is not in the symtab:\n\n```\nERROR: Differences between ksymtab and symbol list detected!\nSymbols missing from ksymtab:\n - gpiod_export\n```\n\nI took a quick look and when I read this correctly, then this symbol is conditional on `CONFIG_GPIO_SYSFS\u003dy` but the `gki_defconfig` does not define that.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android13-5.15:common/drivers/gpio/Makefile;l\u003d11\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android13-5.15:common/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig\n\nDoes your local build succeed?",
